    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "1f45ca0e969ea9b11470e90cf102de6d4ff9763d9eacd5982b9ad2c47b7d9230",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 6,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "へぇ～、アルギュロさんって楽譜が読めるんですね。\nどうやって勉強したんですか？",
      "jp_sha256": "9e3af24d572c31be6279afe29e4f1fa0e0c5f3db2e9144dc4f5230fd8adc0c81",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "와, 알규로 씨는 악보를 읽을 수 있군요.\n어떻게 공부했어요?",
      "message_index_0based": 6,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 14,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b003-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "617f4f6bf4b7f4b625bcce31136d3a116c418d013fe88bd02c6d1323d89c46fc:000002_7516057144600096125:g0:r13",
      "row_index_0based": 13,
      "serialized_row_index": 13,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "へぇ～、アルギュロさんって楽譜が読めるんですね。\nどうやって勉強したんですか？"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "73bdada3e9cc5193956777adc4ee9b68ce6fcf81e6b8797e40106e1b3cf6f9f9",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 7,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "密猟者を退治しに行ったときに、歌っているのを聞きまして。\n彼らが置いていった楽譜と歌を照らし合わせて、\n自己流で解釈したんです。だから正しいかどうかは分かりません。",
      "jp_sha256": "21aa618188cd86f5a08ea6c7f24a110ebf8d2fd71b1e9ca81136dda5cbf64c1a",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "밀렵꾼을 퇴치하러 갔을 때 노래하는 걸 들었어요.\n그들이 두고 간 악보와 노래를 대조하며\n독학으로 해석했답니다. 그래서 맞는지는 모르겠어요.",
      "message_index_0based": 7,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 15,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b003-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "617f4f6bf4b7f4b625bcce31136d3a116c418d013fe88bd02c6d1323d89c46fc:000002_7516057144600096125:g0:r14",
      "row_index_0based": 14,
      "serialized_row_index": 14,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "アルギュロ",
        "Emt4_Enj",
        "layer_中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "密猟者を退治しに行ったときに、歌っているのを聞きまして。\n彼らが置いていった楽譜と歌を照らし合わせて、\n自己流で解釈したんです。だから正しいかどうかは分かりません。",
        "",
        "ch_10075/R18/10075B0_10075_Nml/10075B0_10075_004",
